{"4567970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wellspring", "steam_appid": 4567970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Fort Wellspring is under relentless assault—can you survive?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wellspring is a fast-paced wave survival game where hordes of enemies attack from multiple directions. Fight with sword and skill, unleash devastating haymakers, or activate your ultimate to wipe out the waves. As you progress, enemies grow stronger and special types bring unique challenges. Unlock powerful modifiers to tailor your abilities and adapt your strategy. Can you make it through all 40 rounds?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a simple, low-scope project and my very first commercial release. It taught me a lot about the process, and I’m excited to build on this experience with bigger and better projects in the future. Thank you for your support, and I hope you enjoy the game!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Fort Wellspring is under relentless assault—can you survive?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wellspring is a fast-paced wave survival game where hordes of enemies attack from multiple directions. Fight with sword and skill, unleash devastating haymakers, or activate your ultimate to wipe out the waves. As you progress, enemies grow stronger and special types bring unique challenges. Unlock powerful modifiers to tailor your abilities and adapt your strategy. Can you make it through all 40 rounds?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a simple, low-scope project and my very first commercial release. It taught me a lot about the process, and I’m excited to build on this experience with bigger and better projects in the future. Thank you for your support, and I hope you enjoy the game!</p>", "short_description": "Master your timing and precision in this relentless wave survival game. Hone your skills and discove